<Slide style={{
    background: '#F7FAF6',
    paddingTop: 20, paddingBottom: 20, paddingLeft: 72, paddingRight: 72,
}}>
    <Box style={{ height: 100, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A32' }}>提问三技巧</Text>
        <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 4, borderRadius: 2, background: '#1F7A5C', marginTop: 8 }} />
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 528, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 320, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 180, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E08A3C', lineHeight: 1, letterSpacing: -4 }}>3</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A32', marginTop: 14 }}>个技巧</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 72, height: 5, borderRadius: 3, background: '#1F7A5C', marginTop: 20 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1E3A32', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 20 }}>
                会追问的人，<br />往往用得最好
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{
                flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14,
                padding: 20, height: 165, boxShadow: '0 4px 20px rgba(30,58,50,0.08)',
            }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, borderRadius: 26, background: '#1F7A5C', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>1</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 27, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A32' }}>先问最简单的那句</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#6B7C75', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 8 }}>
                        一上来就想把问题问全，结果自己也乱了。先用最短的一句打开话题，看懂了再往深里问。
                    </Text>
                    <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', background: 'rgba(31,122,92,0.08)', borderRadius: 12, padding: 12 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1F7A5C' }}>「这个产品是做什么的？」</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{
                flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14,
                padding: 20, height: 165, boxShadow: '0 4px 20px rgba(30,58,50,0.08)',
            }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, borderRadius: 26, background: '#1F7A5C', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>2</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 27, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A32' }}>把自己的情况说出来</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#6B7C75', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 8 }}>
                        多说一句自己的情况，回答就会更贴你。不用说得很专业，把真实状态说出来就行。
                    </Text>
                    <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', background: 'rgba(31,122,92,0.08)', borderRadius: 12, padding: 12 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1F7A5C' }}>「我肠胃比较敏感，这个适合我吗？」</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{
                flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, background: 'rgba(224,138,60,0.14)', borderRadius: 14,
                padding: 20, height: 165,
            }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, borderRadius: 26, background: '#E08A3C', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>3</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 27, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A32' }}>没听懂，就换个问法</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#6B7C75', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 8 }}>
                        一次没听懂太正常了，直接让它换种说法，不用觉得麻烦，也不用重新解释一遍背景。
                    </Text>
                    <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 12, padding: 12 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#C9742B' }}>「请说得简单一点，分成三点告诉我」</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="M12 21C12 21 4 17 4 10C4 6 7 3 12 3C17 3 20 6 20 10C20 17 12 21 12 21Z" fill="#1F7A5C" opacity="0.75" />
                <path d="M12 21V6" stroke="#FFFFFF" strokeWidth="1.6" fill="none" />
            </svg>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6B7C75' }}>AI宝儿 · 入门与上手</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6B7C75' }}>09 / 14</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
